  "question": {
    "text": "The area bounded by <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>≥</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the first quadrant is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units,&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/234567ikjhgfdxfghjkl.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 161px;\" /><br />&nbsp;For <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Thus, the required area is<br />Area = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
